<title>GERMANY: German state of NRW details Oct '96 cost of living.</title>
<headline>German state of NRW details Oct '96 cost of living.</headline>
<dateline>DUSSELDORF, Germany 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistics Office in the west German state of North-Rhine Westphalia gave the following breakdown of its October cost of living data :</p>
<p>						 Percentage change</p>
<p> Index/component			   mth/mth   yr/yr    Index</p>
<p> Overall price index		     +0.1	+1.6     114.1</p>
<p> Prices exc heating oil, fuel	  -0.1	+1.2     113.8</p>
<p> Prices exc seasonal goods	     +0.1	+1.8     114.8</p>
<p> Prices exc services and repairs     +0.3	+1.5     112.6</p>
<p> Rents					 +0.6	+2.6     119.7</p>
<p> Household energy			  +1.7	-0.3     100.0</p>
<p> Personal goods, services and other  -1.6	+0.8     121.6</p>
<p> Transport and communications	  +0.3	+2.2     114.7</p>
<p> Furniture and other household goods +0.1	+0.9     111.0</p>
<p> Foodstuffs, drinks, tobacco	   -0.1	+1.0     108.7</p>
<p> Clothing, shoes			   +0.2	+1.1     112.2</p>
<p> Health and personal care items	unch	+2.5     114.2</p>
<p> Education, entertainment, leisure   +0.1	+0.9     110.2</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
